# OpenTofu / Terraform (infra/)
# Provider downloads and any local state. `.terraform.lock.hcl` is deliberately NOT
# ignored — it pins provider versions and hashes, so it belongs in the repo.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
# Variable files can carry account identifiers or credentials; supply them via
# TF_VAR_* instead. See infra/README.md.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Claude Code
# Worktrees are throwaway checkouts of this repo that Claude Code creates under here; the
# subagent definitions in .claude/agents are shared and stay tracked.
.claude/worktrees/
# Per-machine tool permissions, not shared settings.
.claude/settings.local.json
